@startuml UseCaseDiagram
title Backend System - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction

'' Actors
actor "Student User" as Student
actor "Professor User" as Professor
actor "Admin User" as Admin
actor "Guest User" as Guest
actor "System" as System

'' User inheritance
Student --|> BaseUser
Professor --|> BaseUser
Admin --|> BaseUser
note right of BaseUser
  Authenticated User
end note

'' Authentication Use Cases
usecase "UC1: Register" as Register
usecase "UC2: Login" as Login
usecase "UC3: Logout" as Logout
usecase "UC4: Reset Password" as ResetPwd
usecase "UC5: Verify OTP" as VerifyOTP

'' User Profile Use Cases
usecase "UC6: View My Profile" as ViewProfile
usecase "UC7: Edit Profile" as EditProfile
usecase "UC8: Upload Profile Picture" as UploadPic
usecase "UC9: View Public Profile" as ViewPubProfile
usecase "UC10: Follow/Unfollow User" as FollowUser

'' Post Use Cases
usecase "UC11: Create Post" as CreatePost
usecase "UC12: View Posts" as ViewPosts
usecase "UC13: Edit Post" as EditPost
usecase "UC14: Delete Post" as DeletePost
usecase "UC15: Vote (Useful/Useless)" as Vote
usecase "UC16: Add Comment" as Comment
usecase "UC17: Search Posts" as SearchPosts

'' Room Use Cases
usecase "UC18: Browse Public Rooms" as BrowseRooms
usecase "UC19: Create Room" as CreateRoom
usecase "UC20: Join Room" as JoinRoom
usecase "UC21: Leave Room" as LeaveRoom
usecase "UC22: Send Room Message" as SendMsg
usecase "UC23: Invite Users to Room" as InviteRoom

'' Admin Use Cases
usecase "UC24: View Applications" as ViewApps
usecase "UC25: Approve University" as ApproveUni
usecase "UC26: Approve Major" as ApproveMajor
usecase "UC27: Verify Professor" as VerifyProf
usecase "UC28: Suspend User" as SuspendUser
usecase "UC29: View Logs" as ViewLogs

'' Guest Use Cases
Guest --> ViewPosts
Guest --> ViewPubProfile
Guest --> BrowseRooms
Guest --> SearchPosts

'' Student Use Cases
Student --> Register
Student --> Login
Student --> Logout
Student --> ViewProfile
Student --> EditProfile
Student --> UploadPic
Student --> ViewPubProfile
Student --> FollowUser
Student --> CreatePost
Student --> ViewPosts
Student --> EditPost
Student --> DeletePost
Student --> Vote
Student --> Comment
Student --> SearchPosts
Student --> BrowseRooms
Student --> CreateRoom
Student --> JoinRoom
Student --> LeaveRoom
Student --> SendMsg
Student --> InviteRoom
Student --> ResetPwd

'' Professor Use Cases
Professor --> Register
Professor --> Login
Professor --> Logout
Professor --> ViewProfile
Professor --> EditProfile
Professor --> UploadPic
Professor --> ViewPubProfile
Professor --> FollowUser
Professor --> CreatePost
Professor --> ViewPosts
Professor --> EditPost
Professor --> DeletePost
Professor --> Vote
Professor --> Comment
Professor --> SearchPosts
Professor --> BrowseRooms
Professor --> CreateRoom
Professor --> JoinRoom
Professor --> LeaveRoom
Professor --> SendMsg
Professor --> InviteRoom
Professor --> VerifyOTP
Professor --> ResetPwd

'' Admin Use Cases
Admin --> ViewProfile
Admin --> EditProfile
Admin --> UploadPic
Admin --> ViewApps
Admin --> ApproveUni
Admin --> ApproveMajor
Admin --> VerifyProf
Admin --> SuspendUser
Admin --> ViewLogs
Admin --> Login
Admin --> Logout

'' System interactions
System --> SendMsg : notifies
System --> InviteRoom : sends email
System --> Register : validates
System --> VerifyOTP : generates

'' Use case relationships
FollowUser .> ViewPubProfile : <<extends>>
EditPost .> ViewPosts : <<includes>>
DeletePost .> ViewPosts : <<includes>>
Vote .> ViewPosts : <<includes>>
Comment .> ViewPosts : <<includes>>
JoinRoom .> BrowseRooms : <<extends>>
SendMsg .> JoinRoom : <<includes>>
VerifyProf .> ViewApps : <<includes>>
Register .> VerifyOTP : <<includes>> for Professor

@enduml
